            <li><strong class="text-gray-900">Finish:</strong> {product.finish}</li>
            {product.dimensions && <li><strong class="text-gray-900">Dimensions:</strong> {product.dimensions}</li>}
            {product.weightGrams && <li><strong class="text-gray-900">Weight:</strong> {product.weightGrams} grams</li>}
            <li><strong class="text-gray-900">Skin Compatibility:</strong> 100% Nickel-free, Lead-free, Hypoallergenic</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="p-3 bg-[#ffe7e9]/50 rounded-xl mt-3 text-xs text-gray-700">
            <strong>Honest Shine Policy:</strong> While our 316L Stainless Steel and 18K PVD Gold plating are highly water and sweat resistant, we do not promise permanent infinite shine under harsh chemicals or bleach. Following basic care preserves its brilliant luster for years.
          </div>
